<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Happy Birthday Nabilah</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Great+Vibes&family=Quicksand&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
      background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506784983877-45594efa4cbe?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') no-repeat center center fixed;
      background-size: cover;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      backdrop-filter: brightness(0.6);
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
      font-size: 4rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      animation: fadeIn 2s ease-in-out;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      animation: fadeIn 3s ease-in-out;
    }

    audio {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 20px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Happy Birthday</h1>
  <p>Dear Nabilah, semoga harimu seindah senyummu.</p>
  <audio controls autoplay loop>
    <source src="https://www.bensound.com/bensound-music/bensound-sunny.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Your browser does not support the audio element.
  </audio>
</body>
</html>
